category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libabseil-devel libbenchmark-devel libicu-devel libgtest-devel libpcre-devel
sdesc: "Efficient, principled regular expression library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "RE2 is a fast, safe, thread-friendly alternative to backtracking regular
expression engines like those used in PCRE, Perl, and Python. It is a C++
library."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/google/re2
license: BSD-3-Clause
